WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.818 --> 00:00:15.220
the monsters in the auditorium gasped.

2
00:00:17.581 --> 00:00:19.162
"What? Seriously?"

3
00:00:19.582 --> 00:00:20.222
Ben said.

4
00:00:20.243 --> 00:00:22.104
"You lost your treasure?"

5
00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:24.545
"Did you bury it somewhere?"

6
00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:25.806
Mog asked.

7
00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:28.207
"Of course I buried it!"

8
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:29.428
Pedro said.

9
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:30.720
"I'm a pirate.

10
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:33.121
That's what we do—we bury treasure."

11
00:00:33.141 --> 00:00:35.983
"Did someone find it and dig it up?"

12
00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:37.103
Cleo asked.

13
00:00:38.003 --> 00:00:39.444
Pedro scratched his head.

14
00:00:40.985 --> 00:00:41.965
"I don't think so.

15
00:00:42.385 --> 00:00:44.806
I mean, a lot of people knew about our treasure.

16
00:00:46.327 --> 00:00:49.208
A local artist even painted a picture of the burial.

17
00:00:51.049 --> 00:00:54.070
But I have no idea what happened to the treasure chest.

18
00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.292
As I said earlier, I was in jail for a long time.

19
00:01:00.032 --> 00:01:03.693
By the time I got out, Monsterville had completely changed.

20
00:01:04.173 --> 00:01:06.254
There were new streets and buildings.

21
00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.995
I had no idea where I'd buried my loot.

22
00:01:11.435 --> 00:01:14.616
And neither did anybody from my pirate band."

23
00:01:14.676 --> 00:01:16.077
Mog looked confused.

24
00:01:16.097 --> 00:01:18.917
"Don't pirates usually make treasure maps?"

25
00:01:19.297 --> 00:01:19.878
he asked.

26
00:01:19.898 --> 00:01:21.278
"Why didn't you do that?"

27
00:01:22.258 --> 00:01:24.899
"I did make a map," Pedro replied.

28
00:01:24.919 --> 00:01:28.944
"But—" "Ah-choo!"

29
00:01:28.984 --> 00:01:32.708
Waldo sneezed loudly, spewing large green bugs into the air.

30
00:01:33.608 --> 00:01:35.991
Winnie swatted a few bugs away from her hair.

31
00:01:36.011 --> 00:01:38.473
"Do you still have the map, Pedro?"

32
00:01:38.913 --> 00:01:39.534
she asked.

33
00:01:39.554 --> 00:01:42.977
"I think somebody stole it!"

34
00:01:43.557 --> 00:01:44.939
another monster blurted out.

35
00:01:44.959 --> 00:01:47.641
"I don't have the map anymore."

36
00:01:48.142 --> 00:01:49.843
Pedro shook his head sadly.

37
00:01:49.863 --> 00:01:54.848
"I buried my treasure that day and then I went back to sea.

38
00:01:56.172 --> 00:01:59.273
But our crew soon got into a big battle with another ship.

39
00:02:00.454 --> 00:02:03.635
Our pirate ship caught fire and Pedro gulped.

40
00:02:03.655 --> 00:02:06.636
"The treasure map burned.

41
00:02:07.097 --> 00:02:11.178
I tried to save it, but Tears streamed down his face.

42
00:02:11.198 --> 00:02:14.480
"It was no use."

43
00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:18.541
"Have you tried looking for the treasure in Monsterville?"

44
00:02:19.022 --> 00:02:19.802
Mog asked.

45
00:02:20.702 --> 00:02:21.543
Pedro nodded.

46
00:02:22.683 --> 00:02:27.170
Mr. Freaky handed him a handkerchief, and the pirate wiped away his tears.

47
00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:33.536
"Yes. When I got out of jail, I searched for the treasure for several years.

48
00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:35.237
But it was hopeless."

49
00:02:36.038 --> 00:02:36.879
He shook his head.

50
00:02:36.899 --> 00:02:41.443
"It was the best loot my merry band and I ever got.

51
00:02:42.023 --> 00:02:44.926
And all I have now are my memories."

52
00:02:46.247 --> 00:02:47.128
Mog gulped.

53
00:02:47.148 --> 00:02:51.732
"That's the saddest thing I ever heard!"

54
00:02:52.828 --> 00:02:58.632
"Maybe I shouldn't have buried the treasure, but I wanted to keep it safe," the pirate went on.

55
00:02:59.393 --> 00:03:02.315
Mr. Bog started mopping up puddles on the stage again.

56
00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:05.497
Mr. Freaky eyed the wet stage nervously.

57
00:03:05.517 --> 00:03:09.419
"Er, today's Career Day assembly is over, students.

58
00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:13.442
Let's thank Pedro the Pirate for his fascinating presentation."

59
00:03:14.463 --> 00:03:16.904
All around Ben, monsters started clapping.

60
00:03:18.145 --> 00:03:19.786
Mog pumped his fist in the air.

61
00:03:19.806 --> 00:03:21.728
"Yes, pirates!"

62
00:03:22.892 --> 00:03:23.772
Pedro bowed.

63
00:03:23.792 --> 00:03:27.553
"Thank you, students," he said.

64
00:03:27.573 --> 00:03:31.254
"I hope you all have your own merry bands one day.

65
00:03:32.995 --> 00:03:37.576
You can sing jolly sea songs and search for pirate treasure!"

66
00:03:38.656 --> 00:03:41.177
He waved and then bounded off the wet stage.

67
00:03:43.118 --> 00:03:45.338
Mr. Freaky leaned over the microphone.

68
00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:49.199
"That was certainly an exciting ending to this year's Career Day.

69
00:03:49.799 --> 00:03:52.060
Pedro's career is fascinating.

70
00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:59.345
Of course, being the principal at Monster Academy is just as exciting and satisfying as—" Goosh!

71
00:04:00.045 --> 00:04:03.868
Water suddenly poured down onto the stage from above, soaking Mr.

72
00:04:03.928 --> 00:04:06.350
Freaky. "Ack!"

73
00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.311
Mr. Freaky cried.

74
00:04:07.891 --> 00:04:09.892
His noses wiggled wildly.

75
00:04:09.913 --> 00:04:12.174
"Mr. Bog!

76
00:04:12.374 --> 00:04:13.755
Some towels, please!"

77
00:04:14.476 --> 00:04:17.618
Mr. Freaky took out his handkerchief and blew his noses.

78
00:04:20.648 --> 00:04:21.528
"Don't worry, students.

79
00:04:21.848 --> 00:04:24.129
Everything is completely under control!"

80
00:04:24.149 --> 00:04:28.550
"No, it's not," Ben said, looking at the puddles.

81
00:04:29.251 --> 00:04:31.451
Mr. Freaky began drying himself off.

82
00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:33.472
"It's lunchtime, students.

83
00:04:33.772 --> 00:04:34.792
Assembly dismissed!"

84
00:04:37.093 --> 00:04:39.193
Ben headed to the lunchroom with his friends.

85
00:04:40.054 --> 00:04:44.035
Along the way all the students were still talking about pirates and treasure.

86
00:04:44.055 --> 00:04:47.936
"Pedro's career sounds awesome," Mog said.

87
00:04:48.584 --> 00:04:50.985
"Much better than the dust collector's job."

88
00:04:51.846 --> 00:04:52.746
Gaby laughed.

89
00:04:52.766 --> 00:04:55.207
"How would you know, Mog?

90
00:04:55.407 --> 00:04:57.928
You were sleeping the whole time the dust collector talked!"

91
00:04:58.949 --> 00:04:59.889
Mog ignored her.

92
00:04:59.909 --> 00:05:04.231
"Can you imagine sailing the seas with a pirate crew?

93
00:05:04.931 --> 00:05:07.613
And filling a chest with gold and other loot?"

94
00:05:08.373 --> 00:05:09.173
Gaby nodded.

95
00:05:09.193 --> 00:05:11.194
"That would be pretty amazing.

96
00:05:12.375 --> 00:05:14.876
You could buy tons of scientific equipment, Waldo.

97
00:05:16.036 --> 00:05:18.517
I know what I'd get—new detective books."

98
00:05:19.758 --> 00:05:20.658
Winnie smiled.

99
00:05:20.678 --> 00:05:24.500
"I thought you might say you'd go on a dream vacation, Gaby."

100
00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.421
"Nope." Gaby shook her head.

101
00:05:27.441 --> 00:05:31.183
"I'm only dreaming about a library filled with mysteries."

102
00:05:32.243 --> 00:05:34.784
Mog was still going on about Pedro's treasure chest.

103
00:05:34.804 --> 00:05:40.426
"If we had all that loot, we'd all be rich—as rich as kings.

104
00:05:41.407 --> 00:05:43.688
It's too bad Pedro lost his treasure."

105
00:05:44.884 --> 00:05:46.305
Winnie suddenly halted.

106
00:05:46.325 --> 00:05:49.227
"That's it!"

107
00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:51.308
she said, snapping her fingers.

108
00:05:51.848 --> 00:05:52.688
Ben looked at her.

109
00:05:52.708 --> 00:05:54.249
"What do you mean, Winnie?"

110
00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:56.431
Winnie's eyes were glowing.

111
00:05:56.451 --> 00:06:01.533
"Pedro said his treasure is lost somewhere in Monsterville," she said.

112
00:06:01.553 --> 00:06:04.195
"But it doesn't have to stay lost.

113
00:06:04.635 --> 00:06:05.656
Let's try to find it!"
